{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JOB","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"約伯記","commonName":"約伯記","title":"約伯記","order":18,"numberOfChapters":42,"sha256":"3aa72174529879f59c9c24a590c7f512dafc69fc78e843aed0f93864112147ea","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":42,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOB/42.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1068},"chapter":{"number":7,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"「人生在世豈不像服勞役嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他有生之年豈不像個雇工嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他像切望陰涼的奴隸，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又如期盼報酬的雇工。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"同樣，我註定要度過虛空的歲月，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"熬過悲慘的黑夜。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我躺在床上，盤算何時起來。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"長夜漫漫，我輾轉難眠，直到拂曉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我身上佈滿蛆蟲、傷疤，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"皮膚破裂，流膿不止。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的年日飛逝，比梭還快，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"轉眼結束，毫無盼望。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"「上帝啊，別忘了我的生命不過是一口氣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我再也看不見幸福。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"注視我的眼睛將再也看不見我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你將尋找我，而我已不復存在。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人下到陰間不再上來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同煙消雲散；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他永不再返回家園，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"故土也不再認識他。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"「因此我不再緘默不語，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要吐露胸中的悲痛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"傾訴心裡的苦楚。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝啊，我豈是大海，豈是海怪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"值得你這樣防範我？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我說床鋪是我的安慰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"臥榻可解除我的哀愁，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這時你卻用噩夢驚我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用異象嚇我，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以致我寧願窒息而死，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不願留著這身骨頭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我厭惡生命，不想永活。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要管我，因為我的日子都是虛空。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"「人算什麼，你竟這樣看重他，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這樣關注他？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你天天早上察看他，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"時時刻刻考驗他。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的視線何時離開我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"給我嚥口唾沫的時間？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"鑒察世人的主啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我若犯了罪，又於你何妨？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為何把我當成你的箭靶？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道我成了你的重擔？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為何不赦免我的過犯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"饒恕我的罪惡？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我很快將歸於塵土，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你將尋找我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"而我已不復存在。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOB/7.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOB/8.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOB/6.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":21}